{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01LQjBNyULsNpjYhD3Sh579Q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Reframe为\"cautionary tale + diagnostic tool\"。核心论点从clean 4-class taxonomy\n  退守到两个不可动摇的极端：pixel-shuffle catastrophic collapse（数据铁证）\n  和 pure linear projection immunity（π0 offline数据）。中间类（MLP graded、\n  threshold-graded）承认pruning method confound，降级为\"suggestive evidence\"。\n  论文重心转向：(1) 首次发现pixel-shuffle对任何pruning都catastrophic——\n  这一发现alone就值一篇paper（4篇concurrent work全忽略了pixel-shuffle VLA）；\n  (2) CV诊断作为practitioner zero-cost工具（不依赖跨模型公平比较）；\n  (3) VTR作为pixel-shuffle专用修复。标题改为\"Token Pruning Catastrophically\n  Fails on Pixel-Shuffle VLAs: Diagnosis and Recovery\"——收窄scope但claims\n  更bulletproof。仍冲CoRL，不降级venue。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # d108: OpenVLA L2 norm unified pruning protocol\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.95\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: \"OpenVLA L2-norm importance-based pruning at k=0.95 (keep 95%), 500 episodes LIBERO-Object. 与random k=0.95 (69.4%) 对比。\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 52.0\n      ci_95_lower: 47.7\n      ci_95_upper: 56.3\n      n_episodes: 500\n      random_k095_reference_sr: 69.4\n      delta_vs_random_pp: -17.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      L2 norm在MLP projector上系统性劣于random。3-layer MLP (GELU)的非线性混合\n      使L2 norm与task relevance解耦：GELU激活压缩后，low-norm token可能携带经过\n      非线性变换的关键spatial feature（幅度小但信息密度高），而high-norm token可能\n      被MLP放大但携带冗余信息。Random pruning保留信息的均匀采样，L2 norm则系统性\n      移除task-critical但low-magnitude的token。即使仅移除5%（约13个token），\n      L2 norm选中的13个恰好rich in action-relevant info，导致17pp drop。\n      这暴露了跨模型比较的根本confound——OpenVLA用random测到69.4%，\n      X-VLA用L2 norm测到99.0%，但方法差异贡献了约17pp。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      仅移除5% token即出现17pp gap，证实confound是系统性的而非个别k值偶然。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.9\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning at k=0.9 (keep 90%), 500 episodes LIBERO-Object\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 44.0\n      ci_95_lower: 39.7\n      ci_95_upper: 48.4\n      n_episodes: 500\n      random_k09_reference_sr: 62.0\n      delta_vs_random_pp: -18.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      移除10%时gap扩大到18pp。L2 norm移除的26个token中包含更多action-critical\n      信息。MLP projector的GELU非线性使得norm分布与gradient-based importance\n      呈弱负相关——plan_009_token_importance已证实spearman仅0.407，意味着\n      L2 norm是一个misleading proxy。Random在期望值上保留每个importance quartile\n      的equal representation，而L2 norm over-prune低norm quartile（恰好是\n      gradient-important的那部分）。18pp gap在500 episode Wilson CI下\n      高度显著（各自CI约±4pp，不重叠）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table D108: OpenVLA Pruning Method Comparison (Full Sweep)\"\n        columns: [k, random_SR, l2norm_SR, delta_pp, confound_significant]\n        rows:\n          - [0.95, 69.4, 52.0, -17.4, \"yes (>15pp)\"]\n          - [0.90, 62.0, 44.0, -18.0, \"yes (>15pp)\"]\n          - [0.70, 49.0, 31.0, -18.0, \"yes (>15pp)\"]\n          - [0.50, 37.4, 21.0, -16.4, \"yes (>15pp)\"]\n          - [0.30, 20.6, 7.0, -13.6, \"marginal\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        双线对比图：OpenVLA random (blue) vs L2-norm (red) degradation curves,\n        x=k ratio, y=SR%。两条线之间shaded area标注\"pruning method confound\"。\n        Gap在k=0.7-0.95最宽（17-18pp），k=0.3处因floor effect收窄至~14pp。\n        右侧annotation box: \"Cross-model comparison between OpenVLA-random and\n        X-VLA-L2norm curves is confounded by ~17pp method effect.\"\n    analysis: >\n      L2 norm全面劣于random（平均约17pp），暴露了核心confound：现有OpenVLA\n      degradation curve用random测得，X-VLA curve用L2 norm测得。X-VLA k=0.9\n      的97.6%如果换用random可能更高（或保持），但OpenVLA k=0.9的62%如果换用\n      L2 norm仅44%。两条curve之间的gap部分来自pruning method，非纯connector差异。\n      Taxonomy的MLP-graded与threshold-graded的separation不再clean——\n      论文必须承认中间两类的比较被method confound污染，只保留极端类\n      （pixel-shuffle catastrophic, pure linear immune）作为iron-clad claims。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.7\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning at k=0.7, 500 episodes LIBERO-Object\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 31.0\n      ci_95_lower: 27.1\n      ci_95_upper: 35.2\n      random_k07_reference_sr: 49.0\n      delta_vs_random_pp: -18.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.7区间gap与k=0.9持平（~18pp）。移除30%时，L2 norm系统性地清除了\n      low-norm quartile的全部token，而这些token恰好是MLP非线性变换后的\n      compressed representation of spatial information。此时L2 norm的31%\n      接近X-VLA random k=0.5的预期表现，进一步模糊了\"MLP graded vs\n      threshold-graded\"的边界。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"18pp gap持续存在，k=0.7是关键比较点因为X-VLA在此处cliff。\"\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.5\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning at k=0.5, 500 episodes LIBERO-Object\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 21.0\n      ci_95_lower: 17.6\n      ci_95_upper: 24.8\n      random_k05_reference_sr: 37.4\n      delta_vs_random_pp: -16.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      移除50%时gap略收窄至16pp，因为两种方法都已接近severe degradation区间。\n      但21% vs 37.4%仍是显著差异（CI不重叠）。Floor compression使极端差异\n      在绝对值上缩小但在相对值上保持——L2 norm的21%是random 37.4%的56%。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Gap保持>15pp，confound across全部中间k值。\"\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.3\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning at k=0.3, 500 episodes LIBERO-Object\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 7.0\n      ci_95_lower: 5.0\n      ci_95_upper: 9.7\n      random_k03_reference_sr: 20.6\n      delta_vs_random_pp: -13.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      保留仅30% token时两种方法都严重退化。L2 norm的7%接近collapse——\n      保留的77个token中，L2 norm选择的top-30%恰好偏向high-magnitude但\n      low-information的token。Gap收窄至14pp因为random也已接近failure zone。\n      Floor effect：当base rate低于20%时，能损失的空间本身有限。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Floor effect使gap收窄，但方向一致——L2 norm在MLP projector上是inferior metric。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # X-VLA seed44 reproducibility\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"X-VLA L2-norm pruning k=0.7 seed44\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: \"X-VLA k=0.7 pruning with eval seed44, 500 episodes LIBERO-Object。原始seed42结果56.2%。测试cliff pattern跨seed稳健性。\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 28.0\n      ci_95_lower: 24.2\n      ci_95_upper: 32.1\n      n_episodes: 500\n      original_seed42_sr: 56.2\n      delta_vs_seed42_pp: -28.2\n      per_task_sr_sketch:\n        task_0_alphabet_soup: 30\n        task_1_cream_cheese: 0\n        task_2_salad_dressing: 68\n        task_3_bbq_sauce: 20\n        task_4_ketchup: 8\n        task_5_tomato_sauce: 42\n        task_6_butter: 4\n        task_7_milk: 16\n        task_8_chocolate_pudding: 0\n        task_9_orange_juice: 92\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.7是X-VLA degradation curve的最陡峭转变区间：k=0.9 (97.6%) → k=0.7 (56.2%)\n      跨越了40pp的cliff。在这个phase transition point，微小的perturbation会导致\n      巨大的outcome variance。Seed44改变了两个关键因素：(1) eval episode的初始state\n      分布——某些task的初始object placement使得pruning后的degraded policy恰好无法\n      完成（如task_1 cream_cheese在seed42下k=0.7=2%已极低，seed44可能直接0%）；\n      (2) 虽然L2 norm ranking在deterministic forward pass中是固定的，不同episode\n      的observation sequence触发不同的attention pattern，使得同一组\"被保留\"的token\n      在不同episode中的effective information coverage不同。Seed42恰好采样到6个\n      relatively robust tasks (>60%)，seed44则大多数task都落入cliff的collapse侧。\n      28%远低于56.2%的-1σ范围——如果cliff point的variance如此之大，\n      单seed的56.2%不能作为architectural characterization。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: X-VLA k=0.7 Cross-Seed Comparison\"\n        columns: [metric, seed42, seed44, delta]\n        rows:\n          - [overall_SR, 56.2, 28.0, -28.2]\n          - [\"tasks >60%\", 6, 2, -4]\n          - [\"tasks <10%\", 3, 4, +1]\n          - [per_task_std, 38.5, 28.4, \"-\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        X-VLA per-task SR并排柱状图 (seed42 blue, seed44 orange) at k=0.7。\n        可视化每个task的seed sensitivity。部分task（task_2, task_9）跨seed稳定，\n        但大多数task seed44大幅下降，说明cliff point的per-task pattern\n        高度seed-dependent。\n    analysis: >\n      28pp delta（56.2→28.0）远超typical seed variance（通常<8pp for 500 episodes）。\n      这不是统计噪声——cliff位置本身是seed-sensitive的。对于seed42，effective cliff\n      在k≈0.75；对于seed44，cliff左移到k≈0.85。这意味着X-VLA的\"threshold-graded\"\n      分类中，threshold位置有~10%的k-ratio uncertainty。论文不能用单seed的k=0.7=56.2%\n      作为precise characterization，只能说\"cliff somewhere in k∈[0.7, 0.9]\"。\n      在worst叙事中：X-VLA中间类降级为\"suggestive of threshold behavior with\n      high variance at transition\"，不再是clean evidence。\n\n  - name: \"X-VLA L2-norm pruning k=0.9 seed44\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: \"X-VLA k=0.9 pruning with eval seed44, 500 episodes。原始seed42结果97.6%。\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 91.0\n      ci_95_lower: 88.3\n      ci_95_upper: 93.2\n      original_seed42_sr: 97.6\n      delta_vs_seed42_pp: -6.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.9在cliff区间之上，应仍robust。但seed44可能比seed42低约6pp——\n      部分task在seed44的eval episodes中初始configuration使得even 10% pruning\n      导致偶尔failure（如seed42 task_3=92%可能seed44=78%）。91%仍属\"robust\"\n      （>90%），不动摇\"k≥0.9 immune\"的claim，但与seed42的97.6%有差异表明\n      even在safe zone也有non-trivial seed variance。这比k=0.7的28pp delta温和\n      很多（6.6pp），确认variance集中在cliff transition处。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      91%仍属robust，\"k≥0.9 immune\"的claim基本不受影响。但6.6pp的seed variance\n      说明97.6%不应被over-interpret为near-perfect——更准确的表述是\"~94±4% at k=0.9\"。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # OpenVLA random pruning seed43 reproducibility\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OpenVLA random pruning k=0.7 seed43\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: \"OpenVLA random pruning k=0.7 with eval seed43, 500 episodes。原始seed7结果49.0%。\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 46.0\n      ci_95_lower: 41.7\n      ci_95_upper: 50.4\n      original_seed7_sr: 49.0\n      delta_vs_original_pp: -3.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      OpenVLA random pruning的variance应较低——random pruning的expected behavior\n      在统计上更稳定因为它不依赖importance ranking的specific order。Seed43\n      可能比seed7低约3pp，在正常500-episode Wilson CI范围内（±4pp）。\n      MLP projector的graded degradation pattern对seed不敏感（不像X-VLA的cliff\n      那样在transition point有巨大variance），因为graded pattern没有sharp transition。\n      3pp差异是normal statistical fluctuation。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      OpenVLA random curve跨seed reproducible（delta<5pp），确认MLP graded\n      pattern本身是robust的。问题不在于pattern的robustness，而在于\n      L2 norm vs random的method confound。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA random pruning k=0.5 seed43\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: \"OpenVLA random pruning k=0.5 with eval seed43, 500 episodes。原始seed7结果37.4%。\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 35.0\n      ci_95_lower: 31.0\n      ci_95_upper: 39.2\n      original_seed7_sr: 37.4\n      delta_vs_original_pp: -2.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      同k=0.7，seed43 random在正常variance范围内。2.4pp delta远小于\n      L2 norm vs random的16pp gap，确认method confound是dominant effect，\n      seed variance是secondary。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"OpenVLA random pruning reproducible。Confound是method-driven非seed-driven。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # c4_ext: OpenVLA VTC-only (method universality test)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC-only M=32 eval\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_method_universality_openvla\n    description: \"VTC-only (仅训练VTC module, freeze LLM backbone) M=32 on OpenVLA, 100K steps后LIBERO-Object eval\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.0\n      ci_95_upper: 0.76\n      n_episodes: 500\n      failure_mode: \"action collapse — identical output every step\"\n      training_loss_100k: 0.028\n      eval_loss_100k: 0.14\n    result_rationale: >\n      与M=128 (D109, 0% SR at 20K steps) 相同的failure mode扩展到M=32。\n      根因：MLP projector输出的256个token已经是individually meaningful的\n      action-relevant representations——每个token经过3-layer MLP (GELU)\n      独立映射了对应vision patch的信息。VTC cross-attention试图将256个token\n      重新编码为32个query token时，必须决定如何aggregate信息。但在VTC-only\n      训练模式下，frozen LLM backbone无法适应VTC输出的新representation format。\n      VTC学到的是最小化training set的reconstruction loss，导致它过拟合到\n      训练分布的specific token pattern——在eval时面对unseen observation，\n      VTC输出near-identical compressed representation regardless of input，\n      LLM consequently产生identical action sequence。M=32比M=128更aggressive\n      的压缩在此处无help——问题不是compression ratio而是VTC在MLP projector\n      token上的fundamental mismatch。Pixel-shuffle token是spatially entangled的\n      （CV=0.314，information分布在channel维度），VTC可以学到有效的spatial\n      re-organization；MLP projector token是partially independent的\n      （CV=0.215，information在individual token level有meaning），VTC的\n      cross-attention机制反而破坏了这种independence。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table C4-ext: OpenVLA VTC All M Values (Worst Tier)\"\n        columns: [M, compression, sr_pct, failure_mode]\n        rows:\n          - [32, \"87.5%\", 0, \"action collapse (identical output)\"]\n          - [64, \"50%\", 2, \"near-collapse (rare sporadic success)\"]\n          - [96, \"25%\", 0, \"action collapse\"]\n          - [128, \"0% (passthrough)\", 0, \"confirmed D109 — action collapse at 20K\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        对比图：SmolVLA VTC M-curve (flat ~58%) vs OpenVLA VTC M-curve (flat ~0%)。\n        两条horizontal lines在完全不同的level。SmolVLA侧标注\"re-encoding repairs\n        spatial entanglement\"；OpenVLA侧标注\"re-encoding destroys token independence\"。\n        强化VTR是connector-specific solution的结论。\n    analysis: >\n      M=32/64/96/128全部失败（0-2% SR），排除了\"M=128压缩太极端\"的alternative\n      explanation。VTR在MLP projector上的failure是fundamental的，不是hyperparameter\n      tuning问题。在worst叙事中，这实际上是一个clean result：VTR是pixel-shuffle\n      专用修复方案，对MLP projector反而harmful。Claim 4的scope必须限定为\n      \"VTR recovers pixel-shuffle cliff-edge\"而非\"universal compression\"。\n      这收窄了method contribution但使claim更bulletproof。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC-only M=64 eval\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_method_universality_openvla\n    description: \"VTC-only M=64 on OpenVLA, LIBERO-Object eval\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 2.0\n      ci_95_lower: 1.0\n      ci_95_upper: 3.8\n      n_episodes: 500\n      failure_mode: \"near-collapse with sporadic success\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      M=64（50%压缩）给VTC更多空间保留原始信息，比M=32/M=128略好但仍本质失败。\n      50% compression意味着VTC的128个query token中每个只需aggregate约2个原始token\n      的信息，reconstruction burden最轻。可能在个别easy task的easy episode上\n      偶尔成功（如task_6_butter baseline SR=82%，即使degraded policy也可能\n      在optimal initial configuration下完成）。但2%与0%无实质区别——\n      Wilson CI重叠，不能claim任何meaningful performance。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"M=64的2%是statistical noise，不改变'VTC on MLP projector = failure'的结论。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # c4_ext: OpenVLA VTC M-sweep (separate plan)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC M=32 (M-sweep plan)\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n    description: \"OpenVLA smart compress M=32 VTC-only training, 100K steps, LIBERO-Object eval。与c4_ext同一batch实验。\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.0\n      ci_95_upper: 0.76\n      training_converged: true\n      training_loss_final: 0.028\n    result_rationale: >\n      train_openvla_sc_m32_vtconly_seed42 (RUNNING) 的预期结果。\n      同c4_ext_method_universality_openvla的M=32分析——VTC-only在OpenVLA上\n      across所有M值失败。Training可能converge（loss下降），但learned representation\n      对eval distribution泛化失败。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"M=32 VTC-only失败，与M=128 D109一致。\"\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC M=64 (M-sweep plan)\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n    description: \"OpenVLA smart compress M=64, train_openvla_sc_m64_seed42_v3 (RUNNING)\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 2.0\n      training_converged: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      v3版本可能修复了v1/v2的training bug但不改变fundamental outcome——\n      VTC在MLP projector token上的mismatch是architectural，不是implementation问题。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"v3 restart不改变architectural mismatch。\"\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC M=96 (M-sweep plan)\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n    description: \"OpenVLA smart compress M=96, train_openvla_sc_m96_seed42_v3 (RUNNING)\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.0\n      ci_95_upper: 0.76\n    result_rationale: >\n      M=96仅25%压缩（256→96），接近passthrough。但即使near-passthrough，\n      VTC的cross-attention forward pass会restructure token representation，\n      破坏MLP projector建立的per-token independence。类似M=128 passthrough\n      在SmolVLA上works（因为re-encoding恰好修复entanglement），但在OpenVLA上\n      M=128 passthrough=0%（因为re-encoding破坏independence）。\n      M=96同理——不是compression的问题而是re-encoding本身的问题。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Near-passthrough M=96仍失败，排除compression artifact。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # c4: SmolVLA VTR confirmation (mostly complete)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"SmolVLA VTR M=32 3-seed final (worst tier confirmation)\"\n    plan_id: c4_learned_reencoding_smolvla\n    description: \"已完成实验的worst tier确认。M=32 cross-attn 3-seed已有数据。\"\n    expected_results:\n      m32_3seed_mean: 60.1\n      m32_3seed_std: 1.3\n      m32_seed42: 61.6\n      m32_seed43: 59.2\n      m32_seed44: 59.6\n      baseline_sr: 44.8\n      pruning_sr: 0.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      SmolVLA VTR数据已完整收集，不受worst tier影响。所有3-seed评估在[58, 65]\n      范围内（与worst tier定义的smolvla_vtr_m32_sr一致）。这是worst叙事中\n      最强的正面证据：VTR在pixel-shuffle上从0%恢复到60%+是iron-clad的。\n      3-seed std=1.3%极低，排除lucky seed。Cross-suite（Spatial 53.2%,\n      Goal 56.4%）进一步确认泛化性。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      SmolVLA VTR数据不需要修改。在worst叙事中，这是核心positive contribution：\n      \"pixel-shuffle cliff-edge + VTR recovery\"成为论文的主干。\n\n  - name: \"SmolVLA VTR M-curve flat confirmation\"\n    plan_id: c4_learned_reencoding_smolvla\n    description: \"M=16/32/64/96/128全sweep 3-seed数据已完成。确认M-curve flat。\"\n    expected_results:\n      m16_mean: 56.9\n      m32_mean: 60.1\n      m64_mean: 62.0\n      m96_mean: 54.5\n      m128_mean: 58.0\n      range_pp: 7.5\n      all_within_5pp_of_baseline: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      已有数据确认M-curve flat（所有M值在54.5-62.0%范围内，max spread 7.5pp）。\n      这证明VTR对pixel-shuffle connector实现near-lossless compression at any ratio——\n      M=16（87.5%压缩）与M=128（passthrough）performance无统计差异。\n      Worst tier不影响此结论，因为数据已locked。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table C4: SmolVLA VTR M-Curve (3-seed, confirmed)\"\n        columns: [M, compression, mean_SR, std, \"vs 0% pruning\"]\n        rows:\n          - [16, \"87.5%\", 56.9, 1.3, \"+56.9pp\"]\n          - [32, \"75%\", 60.1, 1.3, \"+60.1pp\"]\n          - [64, \"50%\", 62.0, 2.3, \"+62.0pp\"]\n          - [96, \"25%\", 54.5, 3.2, \"+54.5pp\"]\n          - [128, \"0%\", 58.0, 3.5, \"+58.0pp\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"M-curve flat是VTR方法的最强证据——对pixel-shuffle实现任意压缩比。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # c5: RoboFlamingo Perceiver Resampler\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"RoboFlamingo LIBERO-Object baseline\"\n    plan_id: c5_third_connector_roboflamingo\n    description: \"RoboFlamingo (Perceiver Resampler connector) fine-tune on LIBERO-Object, baseline SR evaluation\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"not_completed_before_deadline\"\n      estimated_sr: null\n      training_convergence: \"unknown\"\n      days_required: 3\n      days_remaining: 6\n    result_rationale: >\n      距CoRL abstract截止6天（May 26），paper截止9天（May 29）。\n      RoboFlamingo需要：(1) 代码适配LIBERO（OpenFlamingo→RoboFlamingo→LIBERO，\n      可能需要1-2天debug action space/observation format差异）；\n      (2) fine-tuning ≥100K steps（~8-12小时single GPU）；\n      (3) baseline eval 500×10 episodes（~4-6小时）；\n      (4) pruning sweep至少3个k值（额外~12小时）；\n      (5) importance分析（CV, entropy, 额外~2小时）。\n      总计需要~3天clean execution + debug time。考虑到GPU资源竞争\n      （其他实验也在使用），且RoboFlamingo的LIBERO适配从未被验证过\n      （train_c5_roboflamingo_v2已killed），在worst scenario下这个实验\n      被deprioritized。即使baseline完成，pruning sweep也来不及写入paper。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      C5在deadline前无法完成。在worst叙事中，收窄scope后不再需要第5个模型——\n      论文聚焦pixel-shuffle catastrophe + linear immunity两个极端，\n      不主张exhaustive connector coverage。Perceiver Resampler列入\n      Limitations & Future Work：\"We leave Perceiver-style connectors\n      (e.g., Flamingo) to future work.\"\n\n  - name: \"RoboFlamingo pruning sweep (if baseline completes)\"\n    plan_id: c5_third_connector_roboflamingo\n    description: \"RoboFlamingo pruning k=0.5/0.7/0.9 + importance CV analysis。依赖baseline完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"not_attempted\"\n      blocked_by: \"baseline not completed\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Baseline未完成，pruning sweep无法开始。即使在parallel universe中baseline\n      完成且SR>40%，Perceiver Resampler的pruning behavior prediction是uncertain——\n      Perceiver使用learned query tokens cross-attend to vision features，\n      理论上介于linear projection和pixel-shuffle之间。CV预测值可能在0.1-0.2范围。\n      但这些是speculation，无法在deadline前验证。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"无法在deadline前完成，全部列入future work。\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17726,"cache_read_input_tokens":53488,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17726},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"25efd361-2a2b-42d8-ae52-81f37e346f1b","uuid":"2e08f441-33cc-42e6-93d0-c3b70256c27c"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":468158,"duration_api_ms":469999,"num_turns":5,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Reframe为\"cautionary tale + diagnostic tool\"。核心论点从clean 4-class taxonomy\n  退守到两个不可动摇的极端：pixel-shuffle catastrophic collapse（数据铁证）\n  和 pure linear projection immunity（π0 offline数据）。中间类（MLP graded、\n  threshold-graded）承认pruning method confound，降级为\"suggestive evidence\"。\n  论文重心转向：(1) 首次发现pixel-shuffle对任何pruning都catastrophic——\n  这一发现alone就值一篇paper（4篇concurrent work全忽略了pixel-shuffle VLA）；\n  (2) CV诊断作为practitioner zero-cost工具（不依赖跨模型公平比较）；\n  (3) VTR作为pixel-shuffle专用修复。标题改为\"Token Pruning Catastrophically\n  Fails on Pixel-Shuffle VLAs: Diagnosis and Recovery\"——收窄scope但claims\n  更bulletproof。仍冲CoRL，不降级venue。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # d108: OpenVLA L2 norm unified pruning protocol\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.95\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: \"OpenVLA L2-norm importance-based pruning at k=0.95 (keep 95%), 500 episodes LIBERO-Object. 与random k=0.95 (69.4%) 对比。\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 52.0\n      ci_95_lower: 47.7\n      ci_95_upper: 56.3\n      n_episodes: 500\n      random_k095_reference_sr: 69.4\n      delta_vs_random_pp: -17.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      L2 norm在MLP projector上系统性劣于random。3-layer MLP (GELU)的非线性混合\n      使L2 norm与task relevance解耦：GELU激活压缩后，low-norm token可能携带经过\n      非线性变换的关键spatial feature（幅度小但信息密度高），而high-norm token可能\n      被MLP放大但携带冗余信息。Random pruning保留信息的均匀采样，L2 norm则系统性\n      移除task-critical但low-magnitude的token。即使仅移除5%（约13个token），\n      L2 norm选中的13个恰好rich in action-relevant info，导致17pp drop。\n      这暴露了跨模型比较的根本confound——OpenVLA用random测到69.4%，\n      X-VLA用L2 norm测到99.0%，但方法差异贡献了约17pp。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      仅移除5% token即出现17pp gap，证实confound是系统性的而非个别k值偶然。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.9\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning at k=0.9 (keep 90%), 500 episodes LIBERO-Object\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 44.0\n      ci_95_lower: 39.7\n      ci_95_upper: 48.4\n      n_episodes: 500\n      random_k09_reference_sr: 62.0\n      delta_vs_random_pp: -18.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      移除10%时gap扩大到18pp。L2 norm移除的26个token中包含更多action-critical\n      信息。MLP projector的GELU非线性使得norm分布与gradient-based importance\n      呈弱负相关——plan_009_token_importance已证实spearman仅0.407，意味着\n      L2 norm是一个misleading proxy。Random在期望值上保留每个importance quartile\n      的equal representation，而L2 norm over-prune低norm quartile（恰好是\n      gradient-important的那部分）。18pp gap在500 episode Wilson CI下\n      高度显著（各自CI约±4pp，不重叠）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table D108: OpenVLA Pruning Method Comparison (Full Sweep)\"\n        columns: [k, random_SR, l2norm_SR, delta_pp, confound_significant]\n        rows:\n          - [0.95, 69.4, 52.0, -17.4, \"yes (>15pp)\"]\n          - [0.90, 62.0, 44.0, -18.0, \"yes (>15pp)\"]\n          - [0.70, 49.0, 31.0, -18.0, \"yes (>15pp)\"]\n          - [0.50, 37.4, 21.0, -16.4, \"yes (>15pp)\"]\n          - [0.30, 20.6, 7.0, -13.6, \"marginal\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        双线对比图：OpenVLA random (blue) vs L2-norm (red) degradation curves,\n        x=k ratio, y=SR%。两条线之间shaded area标注\"pruning method confound\"。\n        Gap在k=0.7-0.95最宽（17-18pp），k=0.3处因floor effect收窄至~14pp。\n        右侧annotation box: \"Cross-model comparison between OpenVLA-random and\n        X-VLA-L2norm curves is confounded by ~17pp method effect.\"\n    analysis: >\n      L2 norm全面劣于random（平均约17pp），暴露了核心confound：现有OpenVLA\n      degradation curve用random测得，X-VLA curve用L2 norm测得。X-VLA k=0.9\n      的97.6%如果换用random可能更高（或保持），但OpenVLA k=0.9的62%如果换用\n      L2 norm仅44%。两条curve之间的gap部分来自pruning method，非纯connector差异。\n      Taxonomy的MLP-graded与threshold-graded的separation不再clean——\n      论文必须承认中间两类的比较被method confound污染，只保留极端类\n      （pixel-shuffle catastrophic, pure linear immune）作为iron-clad claims。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.7\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning at k=0.7, 500 episodes LIBERO-Object\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 31.0\n      ci_95_lower: 27.1\n      ci_95_upper: 35.2\n      random_k07_reference_sr: 49.0\n      delta_vs_random_pp: -18.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.7区间gap与k=0.9持平（~18pp）。移除30%时，L2 norm系统性地清除了\n      low-norm quartile的全部token，而这些token恰好是MLP非线性变换后的\n      compressed representation of spatial information。此时L2 norm的31%\n      接近X-VLA random k=0.5的预期表现，进一步模糊了\"MLP graded vs\n      threshold-graded\"的边界。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"18pp gap持续存在，k=0.7是关键比较点因为X-VLA在此处cliff。\"\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.5\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning at k=0.5, 500 episodes LIBERO-Object\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 21.0\n      ci_95_lower: 17.6\n      ci_95_upper: 24.8\n      random_k05_reference_sr: 37.4\n      delta_vs_random_pp: -16.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      移除50%时gap略收窄至16pp，因为两种方法都已接近severe degradation区间。\n      但21% vs 37.4%仍是显著差异（CI不重叠）。Floor compression使极端差异\n      在绝对值上缩小但在相对值上保持——L2 norm的21%是random 37.4%的56%。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Gap保持>15pp，confound across全部中间k值。\"\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning k=0.3\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: \"OpenVLA L2-norm pruning at k=0.3, 500 episodes LIBERO-Object\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 7.0\n      ci_95_lower: 5.0\n      ci_95_upper: 9.7\n      random_k03_reference_sr: 20.6\n      delta_vs_random_pp: -13.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      保留仅30% token时两种方法都严重退化。L2 norm的7%接近collapse——\n      保留的77个token中，L2 norm选择的top-30%恰好偏向high-magnitude但\n      low-information的token。Gap收窄至14pp因为random也已接近failure zone。\n      Floor effect：当base rate低于20%时，能损失的空间本身有限。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Floor effect使gap收窄，但方向一致——L2 norm在MLP projector上是inferior metric。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # X-VLA seed44 reproducibility\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"X-VLA L2-norm pruning k=0.7 seed44\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: \"X-VLA k=0.7 pruning with eval seed44, 500 episodes LIBERO-Object。原始seed42结果56.2%。测试cliff pattern跨seed稳健性。\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 28.0\n      ci_95_lower: 24.2\n      ci_95_upper: 32.1\n      n_episodes: 500\n      original_seed42_sr: 56.2\n      delta_vs_seed42_pp: -28.2\n      per_task_sr_sketch:\n        task_0_alphabet_soup: 30\n        task_1_cream_cheese: 0\n        task_2_salad_dressing: 68\n        task_3_bbq_sauce: 20\n        task_4_ketchup: 8\n        task_5_tomato_sauce: 42\n        task_6_butter: 4\n        task_7_milk: 16\n        task_8_chocolate_pudding: 0\n        task_9_orange_juice: 92\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.7是X-VLA degradation curve的最陡峭转变区间：k=0.9 (97.6%) → k=0.7 (56.2%)\n      跨越了40pp的cliff。在这个phase transition point，微小的perturbation会导致\n      巨大的outcome variance。Seed44改变了两个关键因素：(1) eval episode的初始state\n      分布——某些task的初始object placement使得pruning后的degraded policy恰好无法\n      完成（如task_1 cream_cheese在seed42下k=0.7=2%已极低，seed44可能直接0%）；\n      (2) 虽然L2 norm ranking在deterministic forward pass中是固定的，不同episode\n      的observation sequence触发不同的attention pattern，使得同一组\"被保留\"的token\n      在不同episode中的effective information coverage不同。Seed42恰好采样到6个\n      relatively robust tasks (>60%)，seed44则大多数task都落入cliff的collapse侧。\n      28%远低于56.2%的-1σ范围——如果cliff point的variance如此之大，\n      单seed的56.2%不能作为architectural characterization。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: X-VLA k=0.7 Cross-Seed Comparison\"\n        columns: [metric, seed42, seed44, delta]\n        rows:\n          - [overall_SR, 56.2, 28.0, -28.2]\n          - [\"tasks >60%\", 6, 2, -4]\n          - [\"tasks <10%\", 3, 4, +1]\n          - [per_task_std, 38.5, 28.4, \"-\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        X-VLA per-task SR并排柱状图 (seed42 blue, seed44 orange) at k=0.7。\n        可视化每个task的seed sensitivity。部分task（task_2, task_9）跨seed稳定，\n        但大多数task seed44大幅下降，说明cliff point的per-task pattern\n        高度seed-dependent。\n    analysis: >\n      28pp delta（56.2→28.0）远超typical seed variance（通常<8pp for 500 episodes）。\n      这不是统计噪声——cliff位置本身是seed-sensitive的。对于seed42，effective cliff\n      在k≈0.75；对于seed44，cliff左移到k≈0.85。这意味着X-VLA的\"threshold-graded\"\n      分类中，threshold位置有~10%的k-ratio uncertainty。论文不能用单seed的k=0.7=56.2%\n      作为precise characterization，只能说\"cliff somewhere in k∈[0.7, 0.9]\"。\n      在worst叙事中：X-VLA中间类降级为\"suggestive of threshold behavior with\n      high variance at transition\"，不再是clean evidence。\n\n  - name: \"X-VLA L2-norm pruning k=0.9 seed44\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: \"X-VLA k=0.9 pruning with eval seed44, 500 episodes。原始seed42结果97.6%。\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 91.0\n      ci_95_lower: 88.3\n      ci_95_upper: 93.2\n      original_seed42_sr: 97.6\n      delta_vs_seed42_pp: -6.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=0.9在cliff区间之上，应仍robust。但seed44可能比seed42低约6pp——\n      部分task在seed44的eval episodes中初始configuration使得even 10% pruning\n      导致偶尔failure（如seed42 task_3=92%可能seed44=78%）。91%仍属\"robust\"\n      （>90%），不动摇\"k≥0.9 immune\"的claim，但与seed42的97.6%有差异表明\n      even在safe zone也有non-trivial seed variance。这比k=0.7的28pp delta温和\n      很多（6.6pp），确认variance集中在cliff transition处。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      91%仍属robust，\"k≥0.9 immune\"的claim基本不受影响。但6.6pp的seed variance\n      说明97.6%不应被over-interpret为near-perfect——更准确的表述是\"~94±4% at k=0.9\"。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # OpenVLA random pruning seed43 reproducibility\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OpenVLA random pruning k=0.7 seed43\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: \"OpenVLA random pruning k=0.7 with eval seed43, 500 episodes。原始seed7结果49.0%。\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 46.0\n      ci_95_lower: 41.7\n      ci_95_upper: 50.4\n      original_seed7_sr: 49.0\n      delta_vs_original_pp: -3.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      OpenVLA random pruning的variance应较低——random pruning的expected behavior\n      在统计上更稳定因为它不依赖importance ranking的specific order。Seed43\n      可能比seed7低约3pp，在正常500-episode Wilson CI范围内（±4pp）。\n      MLP projector的graded degradation pattern对seed不敏感（不像X-VLA的cliff\n      那样在transition point有巨大variance），因为graded pattern没有sharp transition。\n      3pp差异是normal statistical fluctuation。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      OpenVLA random curve跨seed reproducible（delta<5pp），确认MLP graded\n      pattern本身是robust的。问题不在于pattern的robustness，而在于\n      L2 norm vs random的method confound。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA random pruning k=0.5 seed43\"\n    plan_id: d108_unified_pruning_protocol\n    description: \"OpenVLA random pruning k=0.5 with eval seed43, 500 episodes。原始seed7结果37.4%。\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 35.0\n      ci_95_lower: 31.0\n      ci_95_upper: 39.2\n      original_seed7_sr: 37.4\n      delta_vs_original_pp: -2.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      同k=0.7，seed43 random在正常variance范围内。2.4pp delta远小于\n      L2 norm vs random的16pp gap，确认method confound是dominant effect，\n      seed variance是secondary。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"OpenVLA random pruning reproducible。Confound是method-driven非seed-driven。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # c4_ext: OpenVLA VTC-only (method universality test)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC-only M=32 eval\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_method_universality_openvla\n    description: \"VTC-only (仅训练VTC module, freeze LLM backbone) M=32 on OpenVLA, 100K steps后LIBERO-Object eval\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.0\n      ci_95_upper: 0.76\n      n_episodes: 500\n      failure_mode: \"action collapse — identical output every step\"\n      training_loss_100k: 0.028\n      eval_loss_100k: 0.14\n    result_rationale: >\n      与M=128 (D109, 0% SR at 20K steps) 相同的failure mode扩展到M=32。\n      根因：MLP projector输出的256个token已经是individually meaningful的\n      action-relevant representations——每个token经过3-layer MLP (GELU)\n      独立映射了对应vision patch的信息。VTC cross-attention试图将256个token\n      重新编码为32个query token时，必须决定如何aggregate信息。但在VTC-only\n      训练模式下，frozen LLM backbone无法适应VTC输出的新representation format。\n      VTC学到的是最小化training set的reconstruction loss，导致它过拟合到\n      训练分布的specific token pattern——在eval时面对unseen observation，\n      VTC输出near-identical compressed representation regardless of input，\n      LLM consequently产生identical action sequence。M=32比M=128更aggressive\n      的压缩在此处无help——问题不是compression ratio而是VTC在MLP projector\n      token上的fundamental mismatch。Pixel-shuffle token是spatially entangled的\n      （CV=0.314，information分布在channel维度），VTC可以学到有效的spatial\n      re-organization；MLP projector token是partially independent的\n      （CV=0.215，information在individual token level有meaning），VTC的\n      cross-attention机制反而破坏了这种independence。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table C4-ext: OpenVLA VTC All M Values (Worst Tier)\"\n        columns: [M, compression, sr_pct, failure_mode]\n        rows:\n          - [32, \"87.5%\", 0, \"action collapse (identical output)\"]\n          - [64, \"50%\", 2, \"near-collapse (rare sporadic success)\"]\n          - [96, \"25%\", 0, \"action collapse\"]\n          - [128, \"0% (passthrough)\", 0, \"confirmed D109 — action collapse at 20K\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        对比图：SmolVLA VTC M-curve (flat ~58%) vs OpenVLA VTC M-curve (flat ~0%)。\n        两条horizontal lines在完全不同的level。SmolVLA侧标注\"re-encoding repairs\n        spatial entanglement\"；OpenVLA侧标注\"re-encoding destroys token independence\"。\n        强化VTR是connector-specific solution的结论。\n    analysis: >\n      M=32/64/96/128全部失败（0-2% SR），排除了\"M=128压缩太极端\"的alternative\n      explanation。VTR在MLP projector上的failure是fundamental的，不是hyperparameter\n      tuning问题。在worst叙事中，这实际上是一个clean result：VTR是pixel-shuffle\n      专用修复方案，对MLP projector反而harmful。Claim 4的scope必须限定为\n      \"VTR recovers pixel-shuffle cliff-edge\"而非\"universal compression\"。\n      这收窄了method contribution但使claim更bulletproof。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC-only M=64 eval\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_method_universality_openvla\n    description: \"VTC-only M=64 on OpenVLA, LIBERO-Object eval\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 2.0\n      ci_95_lower: 1.0\n      ci_95_upper: 3.8\n      n_episodes: 500\n      failure_mode: \"near-collapse with sporadic success\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      M=64（50%压缩）给VTC更多空间保留原始信息，比M=32/M=128略好但仍本质失败。\n      50% compression意味着VTC的128个query token中每个只需aggregate约2个原始token\n      的信息，reconstruction burden最轻。可能在个别easy task的easy episode上\n      偶尔成功（如task_6_butter baseline SR=82%，即使degraded policy也可能\n      在optimal initial configuration下完成）。但2%与0%无实质区别——\n      Wilson CI重叠，不能claim任何meaningful performance。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"M=64的2%是statistical noise，不改变'VTC on MLP projector = failure'的结论。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # c4_ext: OpenVLA VTC M-sweep (separate plan)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC M=32 (M-sweep plan)\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n    description: \"OpenVLA smart compress M=32 VTC-only training, 100K steps, LIBERO-Object eval。与c4_ext同一batch实验。\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.0\n      ci_95_upper: 0.76\n      training_converged: true\n      training_loss_final: 0.028\n    result_rationale: >\n      train_openvla_sc_m32_vtconly_seed42 (RUNNING) 的预期结果。\n      同c4_ext_method_universality_openvla的M=32分析——VTC-only在OpenVLA上\n      across所有M值失败。Training可能converge（loss下降），但learned representation\n      对eval distribution泛化失败。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"M=32 VTC-only失败，与M=128 D109一致。\"\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC M=64 (M-sweep plan)\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n    description: \"OpenVLA smart compress M=64, train_openvla_sc_m64_seed42_v3 (RUNNING)\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 2.0\n      training_converged: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      v3版本可能修复了v1/v2的training bug但不改变fundamental outcome——\n      VTC在MLP projector token上的mismatch是architectural，不是implementation问题。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"v3 restart不改变architectural mismatch。\"\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA VTC M=96 (M-sweep plan)\"\n    plan_id: c4_ext_openvla_msweep\n    description: \"OpenVLA smart compress M=96, train_openvla_sc_m96_seed42_v3 (RUNNING)\"\n    expected_results:\n      overall_sr: 0.0\n      ci_95_upper: 0.76\n    result_rationale: >\n      M=96仅25%压缩（256→96），接近passthrough。但即使near-passthrough，\n      VTC的cross-attention forward pass会restructure token representation，\n      破坏MLP projector建立的per-token independence。类似M=128 passthrough\n      在SmolVLA上works（因为re-encoding恰好修复entanglement），但在OpenVLA上\n      M=128 passthrough=0%（因为re-encoding破坏independence）。\n      M=96同理——不是compression的问题而是re-encoding本身的问题。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Near-passthrough M=96仍失败，排除compression artifact。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # c4: SmolVLA VTR confirmation (mostly complete)\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"SmolVLA VTR M=32 3-seed final (worst tier confirmation)\"\n    plan_id: c4_learned_reencoding_smolvla\n    description: \"已完成实验的worst tier确认。M=32 cross-attn 3-seed已有数据。\"\n    expected_results:\n      m32_3seed_mean: 60.1\n      m32_3seed_std: 1.3\n      m32_seed42: 61.6\n      m32_seed43: 59.2\n      m32_seed44: 59.6\n      baseline_sr: 44.8\n      pruning_sr: 0.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      SmolVLA VTR数据已完整收集，不受worst tier影响。所有3-seed评估在[58, 65]\n      范围内（与worst tier定义的smolvla_vtr_m32_sr一致）。这是worst叙事中\n      最强的正面证据：VTR在pixel-shuffle上从0%恢复到60%+是iron-clad的。\n      3-seed std=1.3%极低，排除lucky seed。Cross-suite（Spatial 53.2%,\n      Goal 56.4%）进一步确认泛化性。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      SmolVLA VTR数据不需要修改。在worst叙事中，这是核心positive contribution：\n      \"pixel-shuffle cliff-edge + VTR recovery\"成为论文的主干。\n\n  - name: \"SmolVLA VTR M-curve flat confirmation\"\n    plan_id: c4_learned_reencoding_smolvla\n    description: \"M=16/32/64/96/128全sweep 3-seed数据已完成。确认M-curve flat。\"\n    expected_results:\n      m16_mean: 56.9\n      m32_mean: 60.1\n      m64_mean: 62.0\n      m96_mean: 54.5\n      m128_mean: 58.0\n      range_pp: 7.5\n      all_within_5pp_of_baseline: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      已有数据确认M-curve flat（所有M值在54.5-62.0%范围内，max spread 7.5pp）。\n      这证明VTR对pixel-shuffle connector实现near-lossless compression at any ratio——\n      M=16（87.5%压缩）与M=128（passthrough）performance无统计差异。\n      Worst tier不影响此结论，因为数据已locked。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table C4: SmolVLA VTR M-Curve (3-seed, confirmed)\"\n        columns: [M, compression, mean_SR, std, \"vs 0% pruning\"]\n        rows:\n          - [16, \"87.5%\", 56.9, 1.3, \"+56.9pp\"]\n          - [32, \"75%\", 60.1, 1.3, \"+60.1pp\"]\n          - [64, \"50%\", 62.0, 2.3, \"+62.0pp\"]\n          - [96, \"25%\", 54.5, 3.2, \"+54.5pp\"]\n          - [128, \"0%\", 58.0, 3.5, \"+58.0pp\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"M-curve flat是VTR方法的最强证据——对pixel-shuffle实现任意压缩比。\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # c5: RoboFlamingo Perceiver Resampler\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"RoboFlamingo LIBERO-Object baseline\"\n    plan_id: c5_third_connector_roboflamingo\n    description: \"RoboFlamingo (Perceiver Resampler connector) fine-tune on LIBERO-Object, baseline SR evaluation\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"not_completed_before_deadline\"\n      estimated_sr: null\n      training_convergence: \"unknown\"\n      days_required: 3\n      days_remaining: 6\n    result_rationale: >\n      距CoRL abstract截止6天（May 26），paper截止9天（May 29）。\n      RoboFlamingo需要：(1) 代码适配LIBERO（OpenFlamingo→RoboFlamingo→LIBERO，\n      可能需要1-2天debug action space/observation format差异）；\n      (2) fine-tuning ≥100K steps（~8-12小时single GPU）；\n      (3) baseline eval 500×10 episodes（~4-6小时）；\n      (4) pruning sweep至少3个k值（额外~12小时）；\n      (5) importance分析（CV, entropy, 额外~2小时）。\n      总计需要~3天clean execution + debug time。考虑到GPU资源竞争\n      （其他实验也在使用），且RoboFlamingo的LIBERO适配从未被验证过\n      （train_c5_roboflamingo_v2已killed），在worst scenario下这个实验\n      被deprioritized。即使baseline完成，pruning sweep也来不及写入paper。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      C5在deadline前无法完成。在worst叙事中，收窄scope后不再需要第5个模型——\n      论文聚焦pixel-shuffle catastrophe + linear immunity两个极端，\n      不主张exhaustive connector coverage。Perceiver Resampler列入\n      Limitations & Future Work：\"We leave Perceiver-style connectors\n      (e.g., Flamingo) to future work.\"\n\n  - name: \"RoboFlamingo pruning sweep (if baseline completes)\"\n    plan_id: c5_third_connector_roboflamingo\n    description: \"RoboFlamingo pruning k=0.5/0.7/0.9 + importance CV analysis。依赖baseline完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"not_attempted\"\n      blocked_by: \"baseline not completed\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Baseline未完成，pruning sweep无法开始。即使在parallel universe中baseline\n      完成且SR>40%，Perceiver Resampler的pruning behavior prediction是uncertain——\n      Perceiver使用learned query tokens cross-attend to vision features，\n      理论上介于linear projection和pixel-shuffle之间。CV预测值可能在0.1-0.2范围。\n      但这些是speculation，无法在deadline前验证。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"无法在deadline前完成，全部列入future work。\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"25efd361-2a2b-42d8-ae52-81f37e346f1b","total_cost_usd":1.0729042500000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":59373,"cache_read_input_tokens":156224,"output_tokens":23804,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":59373,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":8729,"cache_read_input_tokens":53488,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17726,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17726},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":28426,"outputTokens":32,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.028586,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":5,"outputTokens":23804,"cacheReadInputTokens":156224,"cacheCreationInputTokens":59373,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.0443182500000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"45598a60-83c8-4123-87ee-693b9a76b80d"}
